      "message": "test(sim): give main's new Move literals the rotary field\n\nMerging main brought three sim test files (#280 stock_dual, #282\nhidden_rest_banded, #200 stock_lathe_blade) that build cl::Move without\nthis PR's new optional rotary field; they now say rotary: None, the\nmeaning they had before. The cl/mod.rs conflict (mod rotary / pub mod\ntext) keeps both lines.\n\nRefs #33\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
